operation addCommonHeaders
input operation addCommonHeaders response HttpResponse
output operation addCommonHeaders Void
effect addCommonHeaders write http.response
memory addCommonHeaders arena request
async addCommonHeaders no
useCapability addCommonHeaders httpResponseWriter
purpose operation addCommonHeaders "Attach stable API headers before a response body is written."
invariant operation addCommonHeaders "Headers are static and written before any response body writer runs."
label startAddCommonHeaders
storage local immutable apiHeaderName String "X-Api-Version"
call apiHeaderCall http.responseHeader
argument apiHeaderCall response HttpResponse response
argument apiHeaderCall name String apiHeaderName
argument apiHeaderCall value String runtime.apiVersionText
run apiHeaderCall
ignore value source apiHeaderCall type Int32
storage local immutable bodyLimitHeaderName String "X-Max-Body-Bytes"
storage local immutable bodyLimitHeaderValue String "65536"
call bodyLimitHeaderCall http.responseHeader
argument bodyLimitHeaderCall response HttpResponse response
argument bodyLimitHeaderCall name String bodyLimitHeaderName
argument bodyLimitHeaderCall value String bodyLimitHeaderValue
run bodyLimitHeaderCall
ignore value source bodyLimitHeaderCall type Int32
return void

